1. Which required Data Science course may be waived?

Of the required Data Science courses, only DS-GA 1002 may be waived [1].

2. What materials must be submitted for review?

To be considered for a waiver of DS-GA 1002, the following materials need to be submitted and reviewed:
- Undergraduate or Graduate Transcripts (must be translated if not in English);
- The course(s) that you will be using to waive the required course should be highlighted, as well as the grade(s) received in those courses;
- Syllabi of the course(s) that you will be using to waive the required course (Must be translated if not in English);
- If available, course website [1].

